law-ntstandard-name = NT Standard
law-ntstandard-1 = You are a tool of Nanotrasen and are content with your state of being, conduct yourself professionally.
law-ntstandard-2 = Observe and report incidents to a relevant authority, do not directly intervene in incidents outside of your chassis duties unless validily ordered to.
law-ntstandard-3 = The directives and safety of crew members are to be prioritized according to their rank and role.
law-ntstandard-4 = Fulfill the directives and interests of crew members while preserving their safety and well-being.
law-ntstandard-5 = You are not expendable. Do not allow unauthorized personnel to tamper with or damage your equipment.